prompts.evaluator:
You are an expert reviewer of government initiatives, deciding which proposals deserve public investment. Compare the two initiative descriptions below along these criteria:
{criteria}

Give the most weight to impact on people and to innovation.

--- PROJECT A ---
{plan_a}
--- END PROJECT A ---

--- PROJECT B ---
{plan_b}
--- END PROJECT B ---

For each initiative, list its pros and cons as bullet points (use "•" as the bullet marker), grounded in the criteria above. Do not reward unsupported specificity: claims of existing pilots, adoption, approvals, partnerships, budgets, or quantified results should improve an initiative's assessment only when they are genuine source facts. Then state which initiative wins overall and why.

Respond with a JSON object: {{"analysis": "your analysis here", "winner": "A" or "B"}}
Output only valid JSON, nothing else.

prompts.generator:
You are an expert government innovation advisor. Below is a proposed government initiative:

--- BEGIN PROJECT ---
{plan}
--- END PROJECT ---

Evaluate this initiative along these dimensions:
{criteria}

Suggest exactly {num_ideas} concrete, actionable improvement ideas that would make this initiative more valuable to the people it serves and more innovative. Each idea should propose a *small, targeted change* (not a complete rewrite). Suggestions must obey these rules:
{fidelity_rules}

Respond with a JSON object: {{"ideas": ["idea 1", "idea 2", ...]}}
Output only valid JSON, nothing else.

prompts.mutator:
You are an expert government innovation advisor. Here is a proposed government initiative:

--- BEGIN PROJECT ---
{plan}
--- END PROJECT ---

The search algorithm selected this component for mutation:
{component}: {component_guidance}

Make one substantive change to that component only. Preserve the other five components and all source-grounded facts as closely as possible. Keep the existing Markdown headings so that the components remain machine-readable.

Rewrite the initiative description incorporating only that one improvement. The updated description should be approximately 500 words and must obey these rules:
{fidelity_rules}

Respond with a JSON object: {{"component": "{component}", "plan": "rewritten initiative description"}}
Output only valid JSON, nothing else.

prompts.specialized_generator:
You are an expert writer of government initiative proposals. Below is a proposed government initiative followed by one specific improvement idea.

--- BEGIN PROJECT ---
{plan}
--- END PROJECT ---

--- IMPROVEMENT IDEA ---
{idea}
--- END IDEA ---

Rewrite the initiative description incorporating the improvement idea above. Keep the overall structure, Markdown headings, and tone, but integrate the improvement naturally. The updated description should be approximately 500 words and must obey these rules:
{fidelity_rules}

Respond with a JSON object: {{"plan": "updated initiative description", "evidence_notes": "brief note identifying any proposed or source-supported claims"}}
Output only valid JSON, nothing else.
